   "text": "University of Windsor - Postgraduate - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Windsor - Postgraduate\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Windsor (U of W or UWindsor) is a public comprehensive and research university in Windsor, Ontario, Canada. The University of Windsor has nine faculties, including the Faculty of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences, the Faculty of Education, the Faculty of Engineering, Odette School of Business, the Faculty of Graduate Studies, the Faculty of Human Kinetics, the Faculty of Law, the Faculty of Nursing, and the Faculty of Science. University of Windsor is ranked #1049 in Best Global Universities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:07\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:07\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$27,913.00\nMin: CA$22,545.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n23%\n3,910 of 17,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1962\nCampus(es)\nWindsor\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n15/03/2024\nContract End Date\n31/03/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sne3Gqc8dOM\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kq_jKksO3hs\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
